# LF in the repository, always. This project is developed on Windows and built
# on macOS, and mixed line endings make `cargo fmt --check` fail on one
# platform and pass on the other — a CI failure with no visible cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF or they will not execute on macOS.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Golden references are binary. Never let git touch their bytes: a line-ending
# "fix" applied to a PNG silently corrupts every reference in the suite.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
